cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Tally, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Tally, verified counting in Lean 4"
abstract: "A layered dynamic-programming counting engine written and proved correct in Lean 4, with per-family theorems that relate the accepted words of a specification to the objects an OEIS entry counts. Terms of OEIS sequences are obtained as Lean theorems of the form A(n) = N."
authors:
